# Copy to .env and fill in. No key is needed to identify, look up or reduce an
# integral: a key adds reading a diagram FIGURE, rewriting the equations found
# in a paper into LaTeX that renders, and summarising what the paper gives.
# .env is gitignored.
#
# Pick a provider (default: anthropic). Only the figure input needs one that
# reads images.

# --- Anthropic (default) ---
FEYNMAN_AGENT_PROVIDER=anthropic
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-api03-...

# --- Kimi / Moonshot (OpenAI-compatible, cheaper) ---
# needs: pip install langchain-openai
# FEYNMAN_AGENT_PROVIDER=kimi
# MOONSHOT_API_KEY=sk-...
# Model ids differ per account; list yours with:
#   curl -s https://api.moonshot.ai/v1/models -H "Authorization: Bearer $MOONSHOT_API_KEY"

# --- DeepSeek (OpenAI-compatible; text only, so no figure input) ---
# needs: pip install langchain-openai
# FEYNMAN_AGENT_PROVIDER=deepseek
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=sk-...
# Models: deepseek-chat (default) and deepseek-reasoner. Neither reads images,
# so a figure input reports that and asks for a Nickel index instead; the
# equation rewriting and the paper summaries are text and work as usual.

# --- OpenAI, or any other OpenAI-compatible endpoint ---
# FEYNMAN_AGENT_PROVIDER=openai
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# FEYNMAN_AGENT_BASE_URL=https://your-endpoint/v1

# Override the model for any provider:
# FEYNMAN_AGENT_MODEL=kimi-k3

# Output-token cap (default 16000). Reasoning models bill their thinking against
# it, so a small value can consume the whole budget before any answer is written.
# FEYNMAN_AGENT_MAX_TOKENS=16000

# Give up on a single model call after this many seconds (default 600). The
# equation rewrite is the long one; a reasoning model spends minutes on it.
# FEYNMAN_AGENT_TIMEOUT=600

# --- External tools, for the IBP reduction ---
# Defaults are this machine's installation; the web interface's sidebar sets
# these three, so they can also be changed without restarting anything.
# FEYNMAN_AGENT_NEATIBP=/home/faye/Packages/NeatIBP
# FEYNMAN_AGENT_SINGULAR=/home/faye/Packages/Singular4/Singular4/bin/Singular
# FEYNMAN_AGENT_SPASM=/home/faye/Packages/SparseRREF/lib/libspasm.so
